# True rumours (AutonomousRumours): when something real is happening, a bot hints at it in /faction ("rumour"), and
# others react ("rumour_reply"). The code only says it when it is true. Vague, the way rumours are, but enough to act
# on. named_up: {target} is a rare named monster that just spawned, {place} its zone. keep_thin: {keep} is an ENEMY
# keep whose guards are mostly dead, {place} its zone, {enemy} its owners. Bots can't promise to come ("omw"), so the
# replies react instead. Real swear words are not in the corpus (build_corpus.py BANNED). New writing.

# ---- named_up: a rare named monster just spawned --------------------------------------------------------------------
@kind rumour
@topic named_up
@who *
heard {target} is up again in {place}
someone in my guild saw {target} wandering {place}
{target} is up in {place}, or so my guildie says
anyone want {target}? its up in {place} supposedly
word is {target} is back in {place}
friend of a friend saw {target} near the road in {place}
{target} up in {place}. go before someone else gets it
i keep hearing {target} is roaming {place} right now
{target} in {place}, last i heard. could be old news
psst, {target} is up. {place}. you didnt hear it from me
someone was shouting about {target} in {place} a minute ago
my guildie just ran past {target} in {place}. said it was huge
{target} is out. {place}. bring friends
just saw a group asking about {target} in {place}, so i guess its up
{target} is up in {place} and nobody is on it yet. allegedly
somebody said {target} is wandering around {place}. could be a joke
if anyone needs {target}, its up in {place}, heard it from a scout
{target} sighting in {place}. not mine, a guildie's
{target} is up again? in {place}? thats what they said anyway
rumor has it {target} just popped in {place}
who wants {target}? up in {place}, last i heard
there is a {target} in {place} right now. or there was a few minutes ago
a newbie in {place} is asking what the big scary thing is. pretty sure its {target}
@who Explorer
i know {place} well and i swear i saw {target} on the far side of it. go look
@who Leveler
{target} is up in {place}. i would go but i am mid grind. someone take it
@who NoLifer
{target} up in {place}. it doesnt spawn often, dont sleep on it
@who Socialite
ooh juicy news: {target} is wandering {place}! dont tell everyone. ok tell everyone
@who *
[heard|word is|someone said] {target} [is up|just spawned|is back] in {place}[. not sure tho|, go go|]
[my guildie|a friend|some scout] [saw|spotted|ran into] {target} [in|wandering|roaming] {place}
{target} [is up|spawned|is out] in {place}[. go|, if anyone wants it|. or so i hear]
[psst|heads up|fyi], {target} [might be|is] up in {place}[. maybe|. hurry|]
[not sure|could be wrong|dont quote me] but {target} [is up|spawned|is wandering around] in {place}
[anyone|anybody] [want|need|going for] {target}? [its up|it spawned|heard its up] in {place}

# ---- keep_thin: an ENEMY keep whose guards are mostly dead ------------------------------------------------------
@kind rumour
@topic keep_thin
@who *
scout says {keep} is wide open
{keep} guards are mostly dead. free keep anyone?
heard {keep} in {place} is barely defended. the {enemy} are asleep
the {enemy} left {keep} with almost no guards. just saying
{keep} is ripe for the taking. {place}. someone go
my guildie rode past {keep}, said the guards are gone
{keep} looks empty. the {enemy} must be busy somewhere else
anyone up for {keep}? word is its wide open
free rps at {keep}. guards are down, {enemy} are nowhere
{keep} is naked right now. heard it from a scout
the {enemy} forgot about {keep}. guards mostly dead
{keep} in {place}, half the guards dead, {enemy} not around. go go go
someone hit {keep} hard and left. guards still down
scouts report {keep} is thin. who wants a keep tonight
i hear {keep} has like two guards left
{keep} is wide open and the {enemy} have no idea
rams, people. {keep} is open
{keep} has no guards. repeat, no guards. well, almost
rumor: {keep} is undefended. could be a trap, but still
grab {keep} before the {enemy} wake up. guards are down
just heard {keep} is barely guarded. {place} anyone?
wanna take {keep}? its basically empty
{keep} in {place} is ours if we want it. guards are dead
@who Daredevil
{keep} is thin. a few of us could take it. who has the guts
@who NoLifer
seen {keep} this empty maybe twice. the {enemy} are slacking. go
@who Explorer
rode past {keep} in {place} on my way through. guards were lying all over the place
@who *
[scout says|word is|heard] {keep} [is wide open|is barely guarded|has almost no guards][. go go|. who is in?|]
[the|those] {enemy} [left|forgot|abandoned] {keep}[ in {place}|]. [guards are down|almost no guards|free keep]
{keep} [is open|looks empty|is thin][ right now| at the moment|][. someone grab it|. just saying|]
[anyone|who] [up for|wants|feels like] {keep}? [guards are mostly dead|its wide open|the {enemy} are asleep]
[free keep|easy keep|free rps] at {keep}[ in {place}|]. [the {enemy} are nowhere|guards are dead|hurry]

